WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.327 --> 00:00:16.568
and his companions walked on the mountain road.

2
00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:20.630
The monkey watched carefully for the monster and demons.

3
00:00:22.171 --> 00:00:24.592
Suddenly a demon charged toward the group.

4
00:00:28.516 --> 00:00:29.237
here, everyone!"

5
00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:30.357
shouted Bajie.

6
00:00:30.377 --> 00:00:32.158
"I'll fight this demon!"

7
00:00:34.219 --> 00:00:35.579
The pig swung his rake.

8
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.241
The demon stepped off the road and headed down the slope of the mountain.

9
00:00:42.202 --> 00:00:45.423
Bajie raced after the demon and was soon out of sight.

10
00:00:47.724 --> 00:00:50.145
heard grunts and clashing weapons.

11
00:00:51.185 --> 00:00:52.626
But he couldn't see the fight.

12
00:00:54.006 --> 00:00:57.288
A moment later the demon climbed back onto the road.

13
00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.080
here, Wujing!"

14
00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.181
shouted Wukong.

15
00:01:02.201 --> 00:01:03.841
"Protect the Tang Monk!"

16
00:01:05.462 --> 00:01:07.282
monkey charged toward the demon.

17
00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:11.764
Their weapons clashed.

18
00:01:11.844 --> 00:01:13.824
Wukong fought with all his strength.

19
00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:19.386
the demon left the road and headed down the mountain.

20
00:01:20.126 --> 00:01:21.187
Wukong chased him.

21
00:01:22.187 --> 00:01:25.708
The monkey and the demon disappeared down the slope of the mountain.

22
00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:28.681
"Do you think Wukong can defeat that demon?"

23
00:01:28.941 --> 00:01:30.542
asked the Tang Monk nervously.

24
00:01:30.562 --> 00:01:33.204
"Definitely," said Wujing.

25
00:01:34.124 --> 00:01:35.825
wonder what happened to Bajie though.

26
00:01:36.465 --> 00:01:37.306
I hope he's okay."

27
00:01:39.927 --> 00:01:41.568
Suddenly the demon was back.

28
00:01:43.289 --> 00:01:43.910
was shocked.

29
00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:45.711
"How did you get past Wukong?"

30
00:01:46.851 --> 00:01:51.634
Without waiting for an answer, Wujing raised his spear and attacked the demon.

31
00:01:52.174 --> 00:01:54.756
The two fought, kicking up dust and rocks.

32
00:01:55.724 --> 00:01:58.066
Wujing struck the demon across the legs.

33
00:01:59.087 --> 00:02:00.829
demon tumbled down the mountainside.

34
00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.351
Wujing ran after him.

35
00:02:04.812 --> 00:02:06.334
Tang Monk stood in the road.

36
00:02:07.435 --> 00:02:09.436
For a moment everything was quiet.

37
00:02:10.618 --> 00:02:12.679
Then he heard footsteps behind him.

38
00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.522
The monk turned around and gasped.

39
00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:20.727
A huge, fat monster was smiling wickedly at him.

40
00:02:23.084 --> 00:02:26.787
When Wukong returned to the road, he found Bajie alone.

41
00:02:28.028 --> 00:02:29.249
The pig looked upset.

42
00:02:29.269 --> 00:02:32.232
"Where are Master and Wujing?"

43
00:02:32.512 --> 00:02:33.212
asked the monkey.

44
00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:35.694
scratched his head.

45
00:02:36.855 --> 00:02:37.476
"I don't know.

46
00:02:38.297 --> 00:02:40.478
defeated that demon and then came back here.

47
00:02:41.559 --> 00:02:42.580
Everyone was gone."

48
00:02:44.682 --> 00:02:47.004
"You didn't defeat the demon," said Wukong.

49
00:02:48.385 --> 00:02:49.045
got past you.

50
00:02:49.946 --> 00:02:53.428
He came back here, and I had to fight him."

51
00:02:53.709 --> 00:02:55.030
"What!" shouted Bajie.

52
00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.431
"You're crazy!

53
00:02:57.432 --> 00:03:00.294
I was fighting with the demon until just a few moments ago!"

54
00:03:01.855 --> 00:03:05.198
scoffed. "Do you really expect me to believe that?

55
00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.381
was just fighting with the demon!"

56
00:03:09.382 --> 00:03:11.584
Wujing returned to the road, annoyed.

57
00:03:13.285 --> 00:03:14.846
did that demon get past you two?

58
00:03:15.427 --> 00:03:16.728
He wasn't that powerful."

59
00:03:18.329 --> 00:03:19.250
was confused.

60
00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:22.600
"The demon didn't get past me.

61
00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.741
I was fighting with him until just a moment ago."

62
00:03:24.761 --> 00:03:28.142
"That's impossible," said Wujing.

63
00:03:29.283 --> 00:03:34.185
you chased him down the slope, he returned and— Where's Master?"

64
00:03:36.106 --> 00:03:36.866
Wukong made a fist.

65
00:03:38.227 --> 00:03:39.667
could we be so stupid?

66
00:03:40.508 --> 00:03:41.768
There wasn't just one demon.

67
00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:43.609
were three!

68
00:03:44.869 --> 00:03:46.690
They lured us away, one by one.

69
00:03:47.891 --> 00:03:52.753
Then another demon—probably that fat monster— grabbed Master while we were gone."

70
00:03:53.854 --> 00:03:54.894
Bajie fumed.

71
00:03:54.914 --> 00:03:56.135
"You're right!"

72
00:03:57.316 --> 00:04:00.077
monster must have a cave nearby," said Wujing.

73
00:04:00.097 --> 00:04:01.238
"Let's find it."

74
00:04:02.439 --> 00:04:04.500
The three companions searched the mountain.

75
00:04:08.062 --> 00:04:09.123
soon found a cave.

76
00:04:09.783 --> 00:04:10.904
Its door was shut.

77
00:04:10.964 --> 00:04:13.926
"Do you think this is the monster's cave?"

78
00:04:14.246 --> 00:04:14.986
asked Wujing.

79
00:04:15.006 --> 00:04:17.808
"We'll find out," said Bajie.

80
00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.602
He raised his rake and knocked a hole in the door.

81
00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:28.047
Then he shouted into the hole, "Release the Tang Monk!"

82
00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:31.990
A demon inside the cave shrieked and ran into a kitchen.

83
00:04:32.771 --> 00:04:35.813
The monster was grinding spices with a mortar and pestle.

84
00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:37.974
"That pig is here!"

85
00:04:38.154 --> 00:04:38.895
cried the demon.

86
00:04:40.016 --> 00:04:41.417
monster kept grinding.

87
00:04:41.437 --> 00:04:43.378
"Who cares?

88
00:04:43.799 --> 00:04:46.768
I'm only afraid of Wukong."

89
00:04:46.848 --> 00:04:47.549
"I'm here too!"

90
00:04:47.849 --> 00:04:49.470
shouted Wukong through the hole.

91
00:04:50.671 --> 00:04:52.693
The monster dropped the mortar and pestle.

92
00:04:53.454 --> 00:04:56.796
"Uh-oh." He thought for a moment.

93
00:04:58.138 --> 00:05:02.041
Then he cleared his throat and shouted, "You're too late!

94
00:05:02.641 --> 00:05:04.303
We already ate the Tang
